        "TileImage": "$($repository 3a04acb3-cc63-40cd-a72c-3d763f36e6b3).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. \rYou have 3 targets here in Miami, and all three of them are part of the organization called “The Rippers”. As explained by our client, Damien Darkblood, this group has been producing these chips that induce psychotic toxins into their subjects. Unfortunately, our targets were victims of that. To disband the group, they must be eliminated to hinder their production progress.\rYou know what to do, 47. Good luck.",
